Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(ai_watch): add minimal AI Watch application skeleton

- Create apps/examples/ai_watch with standard NuttX app structure
- Add Kconfig, CMakeLists.txt, Makefile, Make.defs, ai_watch_main.c
- Define CONFIG_EXAMPLES_AI_WATCH configuration symbol
- App prints version and startup message on NSH

Milestone: M1 minimal project closure
